 (text "Passive pin-for-pin replacement. J1 pin n connects only to J2 pin n.\nJ3 pads are M3 mounting lands on SHIELD, aligned to the original motherboard shell anchors.\nJ4 is a dedicated shell-wire bond: solder away from the mounting nut and washer bearing faces.\nProvide a deliberate connector-shell bond and verify hardware continuity to motherboard shell ground.\nNo video ground pins, pin 13, or supply rails are joined by this board.\nJ1 solder cups: 1-12 on F.Cu, 13-23 on B.Cu. Actual connector fit remains unverified." (at 85 122 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f5a1e664-a728-5493-b3e2-d1086a423c26))
 (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
